# Generated by scripts/run-formal-verification.sh and never hand-edited — but
# committed, not ignored. PRD 18.1 requires proofs/*.json alongside the raw solc
# log as a submission artifact, and the SDK loads them at init: a fresh clone
# with no proofs/ reports NOT_RUN, which is honest but is not what a reader of
# the README is being told they will see. Regenerate rather than edit.
artifacts/smt/probe.sol

